{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_120_1000_p", "source_sha256": "037652733b17dba10c97b45e1b8e61a0972c1f349ba0d3a2e7f496cd54e0a6be", "ja": "茜、ニュースを見たか？　例のテーマパーク、\n前にもまして大盛況らしいぞ。", "zh": "茜，你看新闻了吗？那个主题公园好像比以前更加人气火爆了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_120_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "caa5a7dc2ccca5c195f61d0f28976deb51230d181434f999c79e88d7e6bbbc28", "ja": "見たよ～！　茜ちゃんたちがアンバサダーを\nしたんだから、それくらい当然だよね♪", "zh": "看到了！　小茜担任了大使嘛，这点成绩当然是理所当然的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_120_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6fa27f368e44e6ab66f06b798262a6de063951d5b7edb3ac72dc3c32c16dc5e9", "ja": "先方からも、連絡が来てな。\n是非またお願いしたいってさ。", "zh": "对方那边也联系过来了。\n说希望下次务必再拜托我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_120_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "281ecf3d354e0b37d9dd291b18fa2dd0606ab1c78fbab6f2c0404ed9f6777c93", "ja": "ふふん、いつでも受けて立つよ？\nネコちゃんと、リベンジマッチもしたいしね！", "zh": "哼哼，随时奉陪哦？\n我还想和小猫咪再来一场复仇赛呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_120_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "a4911425c780e668a73fc651a803e3fe7b0361039ea8d3297b1ea63d4469bbd6", "ja": "いやーしかし、茜ちゃんって本当、\n才能に溢れてるよね♪　自分で自分が恐い……！", "zh": "哎呀，不过话说回来，小茜还真是才华横溢呢♪ 连我自己都怕自己……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_120_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5e3ae93460f77e2a3113c976686447217604041562ad6a820c5b2949e6f35dd8", "ja": "はは、また調子に乗って……。\nでもまあ、そのとおりでもあるかな。", "zh": "哈哈，又开始得意忘形了……不过嘛，好像也确实是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_120_1006_p", "source_sha256": "38408fc76e94c7409466f7e0b40153885e3f2e5ace1b9b26d71e3cf48db1a4ce", "ja": "アイドルの手腕でこんな風に上手くいくと、\nプロデューサーとしても、身が引き締まる思いだよ。", "zh": "能凭偶像的本事进展得这么顺利，作为制作人，我也感到肩上的责任更重了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_120_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "c7998c2b6fb90f920eaa38c3a1a4ce97d095e8798ed6106fba5d97f41f9fe43f", "ja": "おおっと、{$P$}ちゃん！\n誤解がないように言っておくけど……。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}！\n为了避免误会，先说清楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
